    "preamble": "Moteen Ahmad Bikka vs State Of U.P. And 2 Others on 16 January, 2024 Author: Saumitra Dayal Singh Bench: Saumitra Dayal Singh High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad ?Neutral Citation No. - 2024:Ahc:6862-Db Court No. - 39 Case :- Writ - C No. - 44714 of 2023 Petitioner :- Moteen Ahmad Bikka Respondent :- State Of U.P. And 2 Others Counsel for Petitioner :- Rizwan Ahmad(Qureshi),Zulfikar Ali Counsel for Respondent :- C.S.C. Hon'ble Saumitra Dayal Singh,J. Hon'ble Manjive Shukla,J. 1. Petitioner seeks a license to run a meat shop and poultry farm. Under the existing laws, he has submitted his application for issuance of that license, through online mode. That license is to be granted under the Food Safety Act by the Prescribed Authority/respondent no. 2. Moteen Ahmad Bikka vs State Of U.P. And 2 Others on 16 January, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/86163708/ 1 2. The two paragraph objection raised by the police authority reads as below : \"I. ?? ???? ?? ?????? ??? ?????? ???? ?? ?? ?????? ????? ????? ???? ?????? ????? ???? ?????? ??????-????? ? ?????-????? ???????, ????? ???-06 ????-??????? ???????, ????-?????? ?????? ????? ??????? ??? ???? ?? ????? ?? ???????? ???? ????? ???? ?? ?????? ??? ??? ?????? ???????? ?? ??? ??, ????? ?????? ??? ?????? ???? ?? ?? ????? ??????? ??????? ???? ?? ????? ???? ????? ??? ?????? ????? ?????? ??? ?????? ???? ???? ?? ?? ???? ?????? ??? ?????? ??????? ???? ?? ????? ??, ????? ?????? ???????? ??? ???? ??? ??????? ?? ????? ?? ??????? ???? ???? ?? ????? ???????? ??, ????? ???? ?????? ????? ?? ???? ?? ????? ?? ???????? ???????? ???? ???? ??? ??? II. ?? ??????? ?? ??? ?????? ???????? ?? ???????? ??, ?????? ?????? ???? ?? ?? ?????? ????? ?? ???? ?? ????? ?? ???? ?????? ???????? ?? ??? ???? ??? ??????? ?? ????? ? ??????? ??????? ?? ???????? ?? ????? ??? ?????? ????? ?? ???? ?? ????? ?? ???????? ???? ???? ???? ?? ???????? ???? ?? ??? ???\" 4. It being a matter of dietary habits, the fact that different communities may be living together in an area may never be relevant or sufficient to object to issuance of a license to sell food product or food items.",
    "facts": "The application itself has remained pending since 13.11.2023 for reason of pendency of no objection certificate to be issued by the Superintendent of Police. Since sufficient time has passed, the petitioner has approached the Court for direction upon the respondent no. 3/Superintendent of Police, Azamgarh to issue such no objection certificate, at the earliest. The written instructions contained the response of Police Station Deogaon, District Azamgarh.",
